  "description": "<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"60\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"60\">Hertz DBA 200.3 Actieve Subwoofer | Nette staat | €99,99</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"439\">De <strong data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"84\">Hertz DBA 200.3</strong> is een compacte en krachtige <strong data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"135\">actieve subwoofer</strong>, ontworpen voor diepe en strakke basweergave in de auto. Dankzij de ingebouwde versterker is deze subwoofer eenvoudig te installeren en ideaal voor wie zijn audiosysteem wil upgraden zonder veel ruimte in te leveren. Dit exemplaar verkeert in <strong data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"394\">nette staat</strong>, is volledig getest en direct gebruiksklaar.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"460\"><strong data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"458\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"803\">\r\n<li data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"476\">\r\n<p data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"476\">Merk: Hertz</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"497\">\r\n<p data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"497\">Model: DBA 200.3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"530\">\r\n<p data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"530\">Type: Actieve auto subwoofer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"560\">\r\n<p data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"560\">Ingebouwde versterker: Ja</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"599\">\r\n<p data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"599\">Vermogen: ca. 140W RMS / 280W Peak</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"621\">\r\n<p data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"621\">Subwoofer: 8 inch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"659\">\r\n<p data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"659\">Behuizing: Compact, gesloten kast</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"701\">\r\n<p data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"701\">Aansluitingen: RCA / high-level input</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"760\">\r\n<p data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"760\">Instelmogelijkheden: Gain, low-pass filter, bass boost</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"803\">\r\n<p data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"803\">Toestand: Nette staat, volledig getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"822\"><strong data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"820\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"932\">\r\n<li data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"860\">\r\n<p data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"860\">Hertz DBA 200.3 actieve subwoofer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<p data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"893\">Geen Bekabeling aanwezig!</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"932\">\r\n<p data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"932\">Subwoofer in nette, werkende staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"949\"><strong data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"947\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1148\">\r\n<li data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"982\">Diepe en strakke basweergave</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n<p data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1030\">Ingebouwde versterker, geen extra amp nodig</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1077\">Compact formaat, past in vrijwel elke auto</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1104\">Eenvoudige installatie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1148\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1148\">Volledig getest en direct gebruiksklaar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1170\"><strong data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1159\">Prijs</strong><br data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1162\">€99,99</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1301\"><strong data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1196\">Ophalen of verzenden</strong><br data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1199\">Afhalen bij <strong data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1240\">Used Products Spijkenisse</strong>. Verzending mogelijk; de subwoofer wordt zorgvuldig verpakt.</p>",
